1. chdman for Windows (chdman.exe)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  - Component:      chdman (MAME Compressed Hunks of Data manager)
  - Project:        MAME
  - Copyright:      MAMEdev and contributors
  - License:        GNU General Public License v2.0 or later (GPL-2.0-or-later)
                     (a majority of individual MAME source files are licensed
                     under the 3-Clause BSD License; the project as a whole is
                     distributed under GPL-2.0-or-later)
  - Source & terms: https://github.com/mamedev/mame
  - Provenance:     Official, unmodified binary built and released by MAMEdev
                     as part of the mame0289 release. No source code of
                     MAME/chdman is included or modified in this repository.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. chdman for Linux and macOS (x64 and arm64)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  - Component:      chdman (MAME Compressed Hunks of Data manager), version
                     0.289.0
  - Underlying project: MAME (see above; the chdman tool itself is licensed
                     by MAMEdev under GPL-2.0-or-later)
  - Provenance:     MAMEdev does not publish official precompiled chdman
                     binaries for Linux or macOS. These binaries are
                     unofficial redistributions, recompiled and published by
                     a third party unaffiliated with MAMEdev:
                       - Publisher:  Christian Emmer ("emmercm")
                       - Project:    chdman-js
                       - Source:     https://github.com/emmercm/chdman-js
                       - Distributed as: npm packages
                       @emmercm/chdman-linux-x64, @emmercm/chdman-linux-arm64,
                       @emmercm/chdman-darwin-x64, @emmercm/chdman-darwin-arm64
                       (all version 0.289.0)
                     The chdman-js project itself is published under the GNU
                     General Public License v3.0 or later (GPL-3.0-or-later);
                     see https://github.com/emmercm/chdman-js/blob/main/LICENSE
                     for its full text. Downloaded from the official npm
                     registry (registry.npmjs.org) and verified against the
                     SHA-1 checksums published by that registry before being
                     embedded in this repository — see COMPILATION.md,
                     section 7.3, for the exact verification procedure
                     followed.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. libSDL3.0.dylib (macOS only, x64 and arm64)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  - Component:      SDL (Simple DirectMedia Layer), version 3
  - Copyright:      Sam Lantinga and the SDL contributors
  - License:        zlib License
  - Source & terms: https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL
  - Role:           Runtime dependency of the macOS `chdman` binary described
                     above (loaded dynamically via `@executable_path`,
                     bundled unmodified alongside `chdman` as provided by the
                     chdman-js project referenced in section 2)

